  "hardBoundaries": [
    "Every matrix and comparison object remains in its independent NeuroMorpho source-local frame; card layout and viewport proximity create no registration or biological relationship.",
    "Fit per record makes apparent thumbnail and viewport size non-comparable; exact micrometre metrics remain descriptive within each source object.",
